From 8db3877d5f1cd60bd8c2ea8a0e123320745c1677 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openperf <16864032@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:43:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): defer ajv schema compilation to prevent stack
 overflow during channel plugin loading

Cherry-pick of #61323. Resolves Telegram/channel init failures on 4.2 (issue #61273).
Conflict resolved: HEAD still had ajv.compile on cron/skills/devicePair validators not yet
converted; took PR's full lazyCompile conversion + new SkillsSearch/Detail/ExecApprovalGet
validators.
